  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/P1030011.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Este domingo, 31 de mayo, acaba la ruta del gin-tonic de Hosturionda, que <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=55865\" target=\"_blank\">se ha venido desarrollando desde el d&iacute;a 8 de este mes en&nbsp;12 locales</a>: Man&aacute;, Colonial (estos dos en las fotos), Druida, Chaplin, D&eacute;cada,&nbsp;La Siesta, El Gale&oacute;n,&nbsp;Passatge, Logos, Robinson, El Sitio y Bacchus&nbsp;sirven gin-tonic con ginebra y t&oacute;nica premium Schweppes, marca que colabora en el evento, por 5&euro;.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/P1030026.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Cafeteria Druida, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45, ha preparado para la noche de este viernes, 29 de mayo, el concierto JazzM&uacute;sic-Gyn, con la Onda BigBand.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/OndaBigBandDruidaDivendres29.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 680px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Adem&aacute;s, Caf&eacute; Colonial (en la calle Joan Fuster, 69) complementa la ruta el s&aacute;bado, de 19 a 22 horas, con la Fiesta del Jam&oacute;n.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/FiestaJamonColonialSabado30mayo.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 306px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Se podr&aacute; degustar un plato de jam&oacute;n gran reserva de Teruel, cortado a cuchillo all&iacute; mismo, por 2 &euro;. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/NocheLatinaDecadaSabado30.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 587px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Por su parte, el pub D&eacute;cada, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110, ha programado para la noche y madrugada del s&aacute;bado al domingo una Noche Latina, con el dj Julio C&eacute;sar Aldana.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030009.jpg\" alt=\"p1030009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030011.jpg\" alt=\"p1030011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030013.jpg\" alt=\"p1030013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030014.jpg\" alt=\"p1030014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030015.jpg\" alt=\"p1030015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030016.jpg\" alt=\"p1030016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030017.jpg\" alt=\"p1030017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030018.jpg\" alt=\"p1030018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030019.jpg\" alt=\"p1030019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030021.jpg\" alt=\"p1030021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030022.jpg\" alt=\"p1030022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030023.jpg\" alt=\"p1030023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030025.jpg\" alt=\"p1030025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030026.jpg\" alt=\"p1030026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030028.jpg\" alt=\"p1030028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gintonicsmanacolonial/p1030030.jpg\" alt=\"p1030030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
